          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Yosia atuma ab'okweta abagurusi bona ba Yuda na Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene aho atemba Rwensinga n'abashaija bona ba Yuda n'abatuzi ba Yerusalemu, n'abakuhani n'Abalevita, abantu bona omuhango n'omuke. Abashomera ekitabo kyona ekyo bashangire Rwensinga, babihulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ayemelera aha nyomyoye y'obukama araganira Omukama okwo araba mwesigwa ahali wenene, akakwata emihangoye, emikuye n'ebiragirobye n'omutimagwe gwona. Aragana kuhikya ebigambo by'endagano ebihandikirwe omu kitabo eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bona ababaire bali Yerusalemu n'omu nsi ya Benjamini abaanahiza kugira batyo. Aba Yerusalemu bona bakwata endagano ya Ruhanga wa baishebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia akwata ebinyamunuge eby'Abaisiraeli babaire bainabyo abihya omu nsiye; n'ababaire bali omuli Isiraeli bona abaragira kukolera Omukama Ruhanga wabo. Omu makiroge gona tibashubire kusigaho Mukama Ruhanga wa baish'enkurubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
